BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Elizabethtown Summer Canvassing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T120000
UID:5bfa540eb33e566cb1766535dcd09c21@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Etown%20Canvassing_20260604182253618582.png
DESCRIPTION:Please join us and the Elizabethtown Area Democrats as we go d
 oor to door talking to neighbors about our Democratic candidates: Senator 
 James Malone (SD-36) and Hugh Darlington (HD-98) NO EXPERIENCE NECESSARY. 
 All you need is a charged cell phone\, comfy shoes and weather appropriate
  clothing. Never been canvassing? We will make sure you get to canvass wit
 h a partner.
LOCATION:Elizabethtown\, PA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/friendsofjamesmalone/event/967369/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
