BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Knock Doors with Elizabethtown Democrats
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T153000
UID:599aa05ab371cd725efcb9b6f810182d@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Canvass%20Mobilize%20Image_20260911011255016518.png
DESCRIPTION:Beginning September 14\, Join Elizabethtown Democrats & the Ja
 mes Malone campaign for weeknight canvassing every Monday and Wednesday at
  5:30! Making connections and answering voter questions is how we can turn
  ETown blue this November. Bring a friend or we'll pair you with one or mo
 re canvassers to go out in pairs or small groups. We'll give you a list of
  doors\, literature\, and a Canvass buddy if you need one. Knock a few or 
 knock 'em all... whatever works for your schedule! You can use your lis
LOCATION:In front of Folklore Coffee & Co.\, 1 N Market St\, Elizabethtown
 \, PA\, 17022
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/1032244/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
